WINDOWS - MINIMUM
OS: Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit
Processor: Intel N150 (4 cores) or equivalent
Memory: 4 GB RAM
Graphics: Intel Graphics (Alder Lake-N / Twin Lake class) or any GPU with Vulkan 1.3 or Direct3D 12
Storage: {{INSTALL_MB_WINDOWS}} MB available space
Additional notes: on this minimum the demo picks its Low tier and runs at about 15 frames per second in a 1280x720 window.

STEAMOS + LINUX - MINIMUM
OS: 64-bit Linux with glibc 2.31 or newer
Processor: 4-core x86-64 processor
Memory: 4 GB RAM
Graphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 or a comparable GPU with a Vulkan 1.3 driver
Storage: {{INSTALL_MB_LINUX}} MB available space
Additional notes: on a GTX 1080 the Low tier runs at about 40 to 65 frames per second at 2560x1440.
